        <p>-- Previous Prob. Total bes.Warrington score No 73. Pts Tip For 112 2 114 E 0 a 'IT bIZ-ell, Warrington 107 2 109 0 Vekers, W arrington lO7 2 109 ,-owe, Warrington .......-.......- 99 2 101 " _Massey, Warrington 97 2 99 y marlington, Penketh vans. Warrington. ...... -......- 97 2 99 Peden, Warrington .. ......... -- 96 2 98 :i • Rutter, Warrington ....-....- B9 2 91 j 3 E.l P " Warrington. _B7 2 89 I, Green. Warrington....- ....... -...... 86 2 88 A' r :"Warrington - .. 81 2 83 .4,2,,Banner, Warrington Ri gb y , Warrington ..... ,.. 41 2 43 7,l:Lewitt, Warrington •_....... 29 2 31 A Gabriel, Stockton Heath .-.- ...... 31 31 T groornhall, Earlesto.wn ....... -. -30 30 .1. wJ. Wright, Warrington...-. ........ .18 18 , B Kean, Warrington... ...- ......... 18 18 -la Powell, Warrington .- ..... ......-- 9 2 ii fp ponaghy, Warrington _ rangleton, Warrington - ..... -._ 4 _ 4 1: Gould, Warrington ...._._____ 2 2 i. NOTicE.—Solvers who become entitled to a prize to this compatition can, if they desire, have any "(:)61 on the game of Draughts equal to the value tf 58. instead of cash prize, by notifying the Draughts Editor.</p>
        <p>In connection with the above competition we offer a monthly prize of ss. to the competitor who succeeds in Sol placing himself at the head of the vers' List at the end of the month. Where the prize is awarded the winners' score is cancelled, While_ the remainhAß competitors' points go towards the next months competition. The winner may re- enter the tourney if he chooses, commencing again at the bottom of the list. Points are awarded as 'follows : Two for the correct solution of a prob- lem • two for correcting the author's terms, one for showing a dual solution or a dual key-move, and one for showing a dual continuation at any Stage in the solution.</p>
        <p>For the' followinqint.regtivig cvme with notes, We are indebted to the " West LAhian Courier." "Double Corner" Opening.</p>
