        <p>PRINTING FOR SOLICITORS, RINTING FOR AUCTIONEERS PRINTING FOR ACCOUNTANTS, PRINTING FOR BANKS. SPECIAL ATTENTION PAID TO NEATNESS AND</p>
        <p>Elegance in PROSPECI USES, PROGRAMMES, ac. PROGRAMMES FOR BAZAARS. PROGRAMMES FOR SALES OF WORK. PROGRAMMES FOR SOIREES. PROGRAMMES Fon CONCERTS. PROGRAMMES FOu FETES, ite. Auctioneers' Sale Bills, Catalogues, Conditions of Sale. Circulars, Pamphlets, Price Lists, Programmes for Concerts; Soirees, Balls, &amp;e. ; Rules for Friendly, Building, BD° Co-operative Societies ; Cricket Club Rules, Time Sheets and Boeks,Note Headings.Memoraudums,,/Vork Notes,Bill Heads. Business Visiting and Mourning Cards, Handbills, &amp;e. - Solicitors, Reath nts, Manufaeturers,Tradesmen and °there q uiring Printing of any description are requested to give a al.</p>
