        <p>To its —°Tairats.—ltf.rs. Winslow' Soothing Syrup has been for hilUreiover fifty years by millions ot mothers for their r_eWhile teething, with perfect success. It will relieve „°r!_o poorsuilferer innaetils.L.-,y It is pleasant to taste; and 4PuaLtuees natur4l p, by relieving the child from pain elle the " as bright as a button.”Of all triists la lid per bottle.—Advt.</p>
