        <p>LATEST PRESS OPINION OF PITTS'S LONDON-ROAD, MANCHESTER/ (Just Past Station, through Railway Arch). From " Shottin a Advertiser" of February 2, 1900 : IN THESE DAYS OF BIG STATEMENTS oftentimes as vague as incredible, emanating from firms each vieing with the others as to who shall persuade the public that they and they only are enjoying unprece- dented prosperity, it is a pleasure to encounter an old- established house who, entirely avoiding all make-believe and dissimulation, fearlessly publish a frank statement of figures, wrtified by a well-known firm of accountants, reveal- ing the exact position of affairs, as follows :- 13, Spring Gardens, Manchester, January 5, 1900. Dear sir.—We beg to certify that according to the monthly totals, as shown in your sales books, the INCREASE IN YOUR TURNOVER for the year 1899 over that of 1898 amounts to £7,403 11, 7d. Yours respectfully, W. BOLTON, AND CO., Chartered Accountants. To Mr. Samuel Pitts, London-road, Manchester. PITTS'S BELIEVE COMMENT ON THE ABOVE UNNECEiSARY, except to remark that this VAST INCREAS in 1899 was preceded by a similar one in 1898, and present indications point to a still larger increase during 1900. Evidently the public are thoroughly convinced that to obtain BEST SRLECTION and UTMOST VALUE it Is an absolutely essential to patronise PITT THE RE- NOWNED GENERAL FURNISHERS. Established Fifty- lye Years. DITTS'S.—CELEBRATED HOUSES OF FURNI- I. TURN at 15f, 38}. 50, 75, 100, 200, up to 1,800 guineas, excite wonder and admiration in all beholders. THEY STAND UNRIVALLED. They are a source of pride and delight to PITTS'S countless customers, and of despair to would-be cumpetitors. Everyone astounded at the quantity and qnality of the articles. All desirous of possessing a happy home. comfortably, artistically, and economically fur- nished, should send for full particulars. Cash prices only qnoted. Deferred payments arranged suiting convenience. PITTS'S NEW ILLUSTRATED FURNISHING GUIDE, is universally recognised as the handsomest and most comprehensive extant. It contains 700 extremely artistic designs, priced, and shows clearly how to SAVE FIFTY PER CENT. Post free. PITTS'S CARPETS AND FLOOR COVERINGS. All British make. Fitted free. Largest, best, and cheapest stock. Astounding value. Grand display. lIIMITTS'S BEDSTEAD DISPLAY in Show Win- don's, 250 feet long, eclipses all others. Previous to the Bedstead Manufacturers' Association's great advances PITTS'S plazed contracts for £l,OOO Bedsteads. consequently PITTS'S customers are now getting the lienilt of this bold stroke. pITTS'S PIANOS.—NEW INSTRUM.ENTS guar- anteed TB, YE 4.RS, by Collard, Brinsmead,Kirkman, Beard, " Kaiser," aid many other renowned makers, at con- siderably UNDER usual prices, SECOND-HAND INSTRU- MENTS, splendid selection, some of which cost double and treble. Cash peices only quoted. Deferred payments Delivered first ir.stalrnent. DITTS'S CYCLES, BASSINETTES, .MAILCA.RTS 1 Lamps, China, Glass, Earthenware. Magnificent selection. Guaranteed saving at. QAMUEL PITTS. Established 1845. LONDON-ROAD (just past Station) MANCHESTER, Ardwiek, Longsight, and Belle Vue Cars pass the Door.</p>
